.th MORE I 3/20/74
.sh NAME
more  \*-  file perusal filter for crt viewing
.sh SYNOPSIS
.bd more
[
.bd \*-flpsu
] [
.bd +linenum
] file ...
.sh DESCRIPTION
more is a filter for paging through text one screenful at a time. 
This version is especially primitive.
.sh OPTIONS
There are several options:
.s3
.lp +4 4
\fB\*-l\fR	Stop after form feeds.
.s3
.lp +4 4
\fB\*-f\fR	Fold long lines.
.s3
.lp +4 4
\fB\*-p\fR	Do not scroll.
.s3
.lp +4 4
\fB\*-u\fR	Do not underline.
.s3
.sh BUGS
